a which is always appreciated  don't ever change but that pretty much  does it for this blind review of  jiu-jitsu kaisen's curse training arc  and what do you guys think please do  leave your thoughts in the comments  below or even join my discord server and  if you're keen for some multitude  sorcery then please do check out some of  my other videos or even subscribe to the  channel for very maybe regular jujutsu  kaisen morbidity delivered straight into  your youtube feed but for now this has  been the new world review and i'll see  you next time

